card.statement:
If all parameters $q_i, \la_{ij}$ ($i,j=1,\ldots,n$) are powers of some fixed non-root of unity $q\in\K\setminus\{0\}$, then there exists a tuple $(k_1,\ldots,k_n)\in\Z^n$ such that

\begin{equation}
\Frac\big(A_n^{\bar q,\La}(\K)\big)
\simeq\Frac\big(\mathcal{O}_{q^{k_1}}(\Bbbk^2)\otimes_\K\cdots\otimes_\K\mathcal{O}_{q^{k_n}}(\Bbbk^2)\big).
\end{equation}
